00:04:30.600 --> 00:04:35.380
And I think people make the difference,
not just companies.

00:04:35.380 --> 00:04:39.180
And you'll see that'll keep coming up in a
conversation with me.

00:04:39.180 --> 00:04:41.306
That one individual can make a difference

00:04:41.306 --> 00:04:43.620
and Barry Rhine made a difference to
Nestle.

00:04:43.620 --> 00:04:44.810
It was there when I joined.

00:04:44.810 --> 00:04:48.360
And his view, aside from the company's
commitment to quality and

00:04:48.360 --> 00:04:52.050
