leave one place and go to the next?

00:06:59.270 --> 00:06:59.915
&gt;&gt; Timing, very poor.

00:06:59.915 --> 00:07:02.370
I just take the jump but I think I'm ready
to make it.

00:07:02.370 --> 00:07:06.640
I, in truth, in my, my generation you stay
in careers for a long time.

00:07:06.640 --> 00:07:08.220
30 years in one company.

00:07:08.220 --> 00:07:09.120
You guys a different.

00:07:09.120 --> 00:07:12.117
And I think you've got the right approach
to it,

00:07:12.117 --> 00:07:15.333
because if you don't try out new things,
if you're

00:07:15.333 --> 00:07:18.328
not willing to take a risk, you will
achieve very

00:07:18.328 --> 00:07:22.370
