Citi Group.

00:09:07.780 --> 00:09:09.410
&gt;&gt; Oh yeah, I knew everybody there.

00:09:09.410 --> 00:09:10.950
I was in there.

00:09:10.950 --> 00:09:11.545
That's true.

00:09:11.545 --> 00:09:15.510
&gt;&gt; And still you made the choice to pick
up and try something completely different.

00:09:15.510 --> 00:09:17.383
&gt;&gt; You know, at Citi, if I stayed there, I
